+2026-12-31 / 2027-01 special branch 0
+same continuous path array
+year view = slice only
+endpoint not predetermined
+no path splice
+```
+
+## 14.2 Joint generator
+
+S1/S2/S3별 파라미터를 만들지 않는다.
